### My First Agent - End-to-End Starter Test Suite

# Test 1: Get the complete starter guide
GET http://localhost:52773/api/starter/guide

# Test 2: Get all available templates
GET http://localhost:52773/api/starter/templates

# Test 3: Get a specific template
GET http://localhost:52773/api/starter/templates/hello_world

# Test 4: Get example conversation for a template
GET http://localhost:52773/api/starter/conversation/hello_world

# Test 5: Create an agent from template
POST http://localhost:52773/api/starter/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "templateName": "hello_world",
    "agentName": "My First Agent",
    "description": "My first agent created through the starter guide"
}

# Test 6: Verify the created agent (use the agentId from Test 5 response)
GET http://localhost:52773/api/agents/{agentId}